<Base title="Funding transparency"><div class="page-heading"><span class="kicker">DISCLOSURE NETWORK</span><h1>Funding transparency</h1><p>A relationship appears only when a public disclosure identifies the recipient, provider, relationship type, and source. No qualifying relationship has been entered yet.</p></div><div class="network-empty panel"><div class="network-decoration"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="kicker">NETWORK STATUS / OPEN RESEARCH</span><h2>No verified edges yet</h2><p>The Tarbell Center for AI Journalism is a research subject. Its presence in the research plan does not establish a link to any article or journalist in this file.</p></div><div class="section-head"><h2>What an edge would mean</h2></div><div class="grid-2"><div class="info-card panel"><h3>Relationship, precisely labeled</h3><p>Direct article funding, fellowships, institutional grants, advisory roles, and ordinary employment are distinct categories.</p></div><div class="info-card panel"><h3>Influence requires evidence</h3><p>A funding relationship alone does not show editorial interference. Any influence claim needs direct supporting evidence.</p></div></div></Base>
<style>.network-empty{min-height:340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:40px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#1b2936,#111a24 65%)}.network-decoration{height:75px;width:150px;position:relative;margin-bottom:15px}.network-decoration:before,.network-decoration:after{content:'';position:absolute;height:1px;background:#485b6a;left:28px;top:37px;width:95px;transform:rotate(20deg)}.network-decoration:after{transform:rotate(-20deg)}.network-decoration span{position:absolute;width:17px;height:17px;border:2px solid #b76663;border-radius:50%;background:#20313c;left:67px;top:25px;z-index:1}.network-decoration span:nth-child(2){left:13px;top:4px}.network-decoration span:nth-child(3){left:121px;top:3px}.network-empty h2{font:600 32px 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:12px 0}.network-empty p{max-width:610px;color:#aebcc8;line-height:1.65}.info-card{padding:25px}.info-card h3{font:600 21px 'Playfair Display',serif}.info-card p{color:#a8b8c4;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0}</style>
